# The editor settings this repo actually wants shared (prettier on save) are COMMITTED as
# .vscode/settings.json. They used to be a `settings.json.default` copied into place by a
# `prepare` script, which meant a third-party package ran on every install to write a file
# with four lines in it.
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

